{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_64","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"outcome\":\"ready-for-verification\",\"planSummary\":\"Aligned Story 2’s checkpoint path so artifact identity stays project-scoped while later revisions append new artifact versions with version-level process provenance, and updated the in-memory/read-model paths plus tests to derive current summaries from latest durable versions.\",\"changedFiles\":[{\"path\":\"convex/artifacts.ts\",\"reason\":\"Removed artifact-row process ownership from checkpoint persistence so revising a project artifact keeps the same artifact identity and only appends a new version row.\"},{\"path\":\"apps/platform/server/services/projects/platform-store.ts\",\"reason\":\"Aligned the in-memory platform store with Story 2 by deriving artifact summaries from latest version history and avoiding ownership-style rewrites during checkpoint persistence.\"},{\"path\":\"apps/platform/server/services/review/artifact-review.service.ts\",\"reason\":\"Preserved producing-process display provenance even when artifact review content loading falls back to an error state.\"},{\"path\":\"convex/artifacts.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Added durable-state coverage for multi-process revisions keeping one artifact identity while recording separate version provenance.\"},{\"path\":\"tests/service/server/project-shell-bootstrap-api.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Added server coverage proving project-shell artifact summaries resolve currentVersionLabel and updatedAt from the latest durable version.\"},{\"path\":\"tests/service/server/artifact-review-api.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Strengthened review API assertions so producing-process provenance remains visible in normal and degraded artifact review responses.\"}],\"tests\":{\"added\":[],\"modified\":[\"convex/artifacts.test.ts\",\"tests/service/server/project-shell-bootstrap-api.test.ts\",\"tests/service/server/artifact-review-api.test.ts\"],\"removed\":[],\"totalAfterStory\":558,\"deltaFromPriorBaseline\":2},\"gatesRun\":[{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm exec vitest run convex/artifacts.test.ts tests/service/server/project-shell-bootstrap-api.test.ts tests/service/server/artifact-review-api.test.ts tests/integration/review-workspace.test.ts --environment node\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run green-verify\",\"result\":\"fail\"},{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run green-verify\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run verify-all\",\"result\":\"pass\"}],\"selfReview\":{\"findingsFixed\":[\"Removed the Convex artifact-row reassignment behavior that let later checkpoint revisions overwrite artifact ownership semantics.\",\"Aligned in-memory shell/material artifact summaries with latest artifact version history so later revisions remain current even when producedAt ordering differs.\",\"Preserved producing-process provenance labels in degraded artifact review responses instead of dropping them on content-fetch/render errors.\"],\"findingsSurfaced\":[]},\"openQuestions\":[],\"specDeviations\":[],\"recommendedNextStep\":\"Proceed to story verification against AC-2.1 through AC-2.3 using the green-verify/verify-all evidence and reviewer spot-checks on multi-process revision flows.\"}"}}
